WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 2=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:48.159 --> 01:50.840
Keep a close eye on her these days.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.319
I'm afraid

01:53.799 --> 01:57.120
Young Lady can't
get over it anytime soon.

01:59.680 --> 02:00.680
I'm just afraid

02:01.640 --> 02:02.920
she can endure what's before her,

02:03.760 --> 02:05.239
but not what's to come.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.400
What if

02:09.439 --> 02:10.800
someone gets suspicious?

02:13.280 --> 02:14.319
Don't worry about that.

02:15.439 --> 02:16.479
Our Lanxiang

02:16.639 --> 02:18.680
has lived in the capital
since childhood.

02:19.159 --> 02:21.680
She's also been sick at home
for many years.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.520
Let alone Jinling,

02:23.719 --> 02:25.120
even in the capital,

02:25.159 --> 02:27.319
hardly anyone truly knows

02:27.319 --> 02:29.280
what Lanxiang really looks like.

02:32.159 --> 02:33.120
If she ever

02:33.879 --> 02:35.879
meets some acquaintance,

02:36.599 --> 02:40.000
just say she's grown and changed.

02:42.960 --> 02:44.439
Anyway, from today onward,

02:45.639 --> 02:46.919
she is Lanxiang.

02:51.439 --> 02:52.639
After we return to Jinling,

02:53.240 --> 02:55.240
we'll just have to endure more hardship.

02:55.599 --> 02:57.479
We mustn't let her suffer.

02:59.360 --> 03:00.479
It's just that I'm sorry

03:01.479 --> 03:02.680
our Lanxiang

03:04.319 --> 03:05.879
can't be laid to rest.

03:40.319 --> 03:42.120
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

03:42.639 --> 03:44.879
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

03:53.159 --> 03:54.599
Chrysanthemum greens!

03:55.039 --> 03:57.039
(Jinling City)
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

03:57.639 --> 03:59.719
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

04:00.199 --> 04:02.280
(Taiping)
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

04:02.680 --> 04:04.960
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

04:05.280 --> 04:06.759
Want some chrysanthemum greens?

04:07.360 --> 04:08.599
Chrysanthemum greens!

04:08.639 --> 04:10.199
Our secret-recipe duck!

04:10.960 --> 04:11.960
Fresh plum cakes!

04:11.960 --> 04:13.360
Freshly cooked pork-skin noodles!

04:13.960 --> 04:15.360
Chrysanthemum greens!

04:15.599 --> 04:17.639
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

04:17.920 --> 04:19.800
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

04:20.199 --> 04:21.560
Chrysanthemum greens!

04:22.000 --> 04:24.040
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

04:26.399 --> 04:27.079
Slow down.

04:29.120 --> 04:29.920
How about I make you

04:29.920 --> 04:30.648
something tasty?

04:33.000 --> 04:34.040
You little rascal!

04:34.072 --> 04:34.930
- Watch out!
- Stop!

04:36.800 --> 04:37.480
Stop!

04:39.040 --> 04:40.680
Can't you two slow down?

04:41.480 --> 04:42.879
I just hung up those clothes.

04:42.879 --> 04:43.700
(Young Lv Ji'er)

04:44.360 --> 04:46.079
(Hu Sui'er)
Boys are mischievous.

04:46.199 --> 04:47.680
(Liu Wujiu's Wife)
He never behaved.

04:49.240 --> 04:49.959
Wujiu.

04:50.240 --> 04:52.000
Look, you're sweating all over.

04:52.000 --> 04:52.959
(Liu Wujiu)

04:52.959 --> 04:54.439
Ji'er, come serve the dishes.

04:54.519 --> 04:55.160
Coming.

04:59.848 --> 05:01.480
(Wang Jinpan)
Careful. Don't spill it.

05:01.480 --> 05:02.740
(Lv Ji'er's Mother)

05:06.720 --> 05:07.639
Grandpa, time to eat.

05:09.180 --> 05:12.260
(Mr. Lv, Lv Ji'er's Grandfather)

05:19.720 --> 05:20.560
Hurry.

05:22.399 --> 05:23.680
Little bro, run.

05:24.024 --> 05:25.480
Careful, don't bump into anyone.

05:39.800 --> 05:40.639
This oilcloth...

05:41.080 --> 05:41.950
Where'd you get it?

05:42.519 --> 05:43.639
The shop didn't want it.

05:44.319 --> 05:46.519
The tiles on our roof are broken.

05:46.600 --> 05:47.560
Whenever it rains,

05:47.639 --> 05:49.519
the rain drips onto the bed.

05:49.839 --> 05:52.319
I begged the head shopkeeper
for this piece of oilcloth.

05:52.519 --> 05:54.079
It'll be perfect for the roof.

05:58.199 --> 05:59.240
That's much better.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.736
Now we don't have to worry
about Lanxiang getting rained on.

06:03.192 --> 06:04.120
Put it here for now.

06:04.560 --> 06:07.360
You two really dote on your daughter.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.439
We can't help it.

06:08.519 --> 06:09.720
She's our only daughter.

06:12.720 --> 06:14.319
Is she still not fully recovered?

06:15.279 --> 06:16.759
You've moved here for so long,

06:16.879 --> 06:18.240
yet I've never seen her go out.

06:45.360 --> 06:46.360
I hit it!

06:46.399 --> 06:47.480
I finally hit it!

06:47.720 --> 06:48.639
Amazing!

06:49.519 --> 06:50.600
I hit it!

06:52.310 --> 06:53.576
I finally hit it!

06:53.580 --> 06:54.680
Stop fooling around. Go on.

06:54.680 --> 06:55.460
Go play over there.

06:55.959 --> 06:57.560
Thanks for asking, Liu.

06:58.120 --> 07:00.279
My daughter's condition has improved.

07:00.639 --> 07:01.839
She still needs to rest.

07:01.959 --> 07:04.279
Once she's fully recovered,
she'll naturally come out.

07:04.328 --> 07:05.608
Get back to what you were doing.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.720
How shameless.

07:08.750 --> 07:09.480
Serves him right.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.240
Didn't he see?

07:11.399 --> 07:12.920
They're from the capital.

07:12.984 --> 07:14.744
Like they'd ever give us
the time of day.

07:19.639 --> 07:21.040
Madam...

07:21.079 --> 07:21.800
Forget it.

07:22.399 --> 07:23.879
Forget it.

07:23.959 --> 07:25.480
Why are you pulling me?

07:26.199 --> 07:27.639
Better to avoid trouble.

07:27.639 --> 07:28.279
Forget it.

07:34.959 --> 07:35.680
Forget it.

07:35.879 --> 07:37.079
Get back to work.

07:40.720 --> 07:41.839
Come give me a hand.

07:59.360 --> 08:00.160
You must be hungry.

08:00.920 --> 08:01.720
Hurry and eat.

08:06.344 --> 08:08.072
The younger should respect the elder.

08:08.399 --> 08:09.560
You two, please eat first.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.600
Here, sit.

08:14.000 --> 08:14.839
Sit.

08:21.720 --> 08:22.160
Here.

08:23.279 --> 08:23.839
Eat.

08:27.680 --> 08:28.680
Eat. We'll eat, too.

08:55.159 --> 08:55.759
Your father

08:56.279 --> 08:58.200
hasn't been paid this month.

08:59.279 --> 09:00.639
Let's eat this for now.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.679
Once he gets paid,

09:04.279 --> 09:05.480
I'll go to Butcher Zhang's

09:05.600 --> 09:06.960
and buy 100 grams of pork.

09:08.279 --> 09:09.279
You're too kind.

09:09.919 --> 09:11.120
Don't spend money on me.

09:12.480 --> 09:13.440
I can eat this.

09:36.279 --> 09:37.240
I'll eat outside.

09:37.799 --> 09:38.879
It's a little hot inside.

09:57.039 --> 09:57.840
Come.

09:57.919 --> 09:59.720
Good food is being handed out!

09:59.759 --> 10:01.039
Everyone, gather around.

10:01.039 --> 10:02.000
Gather around.

10:02.679 --> 10:04.559
There's a happy occasion today.

10:05.519 --> 10:06.039
Come.

10:06.240 --> 10:06.759
Come quickly.

10:06.919 --> 10:09.120
Young Master is getting married today.

10:09.519 --> 10:10.759
Our First Madam has ordered

10:10.879 --> 10:13.120
that each household gets wedding cakes.

10:13.200 --> 10:15.120
Everyone can share in the joy.

10:17.144 --> 10:18.550
Why are you still standing there?

10:18.559 --> 10:20.000
One each. Don't grab.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.840
Don't rush. Everyone will get one.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.799
Three over here.

10:23.120 --> 10:23.960
There are more of us.

10:24.776 --> 10:25.670
There are more of us.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.200
Why are you pushing?

10:31.279 --> 10:32.000
Three people.

10:34.888 --> 10:36.440
Young Master is getting married today.

10:36.600 --> 10:38.120
Wedding cakes are given per person.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.120
We got three.

10:39.879 --> 10:40.200
Here.

10:40.600 --> 10:42.519
I don't like these sticky things.

10:42.639 --> 10:44.159
I'm used to eating steamed buns.

10:44.960 --> 10:45.960
I'll put these two away.

10:46.360 --> 10:47.960
Eat another one tomorrow at noon,

10:48.200 --> 10:49.320
and one at night.

10:53.639 --> 10:55.799
(Lin)
This is Young Lady's betrothal document.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.240
(Lin)
And this other one...

11:00.080 --> 11:00.960
Is the Lin family

11:01.800 --> 11:03.160
trying to break off the engagement?

11:03.170 --> 11:04.230
(Letter of Broken Engagement)

11:04.240 --> 11:04.919
Father.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.799
Could Young Master
get married every day?

11:07.800 --> 11:08.296
(Lin)

11:08.639 --> 11:10.679
Then we'd have wedding cakes every day.

11:11.879 --> 11:13.440
I want that, too.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.519
Eat. Come on.

11:16.552 --> 11:18.020
Look at the "Double Happiness" character.

11:18.039 --> 11:19.559
These wedding cakes are delicious.

11:38.136 --> 11:39.150
Don't you want to eat?

11:40.799 --> 11:41.279
Lanxiang.

11:42.200 --> 11:42.919
What's wrong?

11:51.140 --> 11:56.580
♪The golden sunset sketches my thoughts♪

11:58.660 --> 12:04.580
♪All things fall silent,
fearing to disturb this moment♪

12:04.980 --> 12:11.980
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

12:12.700 --> 12:17.159
♪I wonder
if the past has ever been heard♪

12:17.159 --> 12:19.879
The bride, Young Lady Zhao,
is quite something.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.080
Her grandfather

12:21.200 --> 12:23.840
is a favorite of His Majesty.

12:23.976 --> 12:25.112
He's a First-Rank official.

12:25.200 --> 12:27.000
Do you know
what a First-Rank official is?

12:27.039 --> 12:28.600
A really, really high-ranking official.

12:28.980 --> 12:34.740
♪Half a lifetime of longing
returns to this moment♪

12:37.399 --> 12:39.639
Peace for every generation.

12:42.980 --> 12:48.420
♪I still remember your name♪

12:50.340 --> 12:57.559
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

12:57.559 --> 12:58.679
What's wrong, child?

13:01.360 --> 13:02.480
You have to eat.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.720
Starving yourself will only hurt you.

13:06.799 --> 13:07.600
Be a good girl.

13:08.039 --> 13:09.519
Here, eat.

13:12.919 --> 13:13.720
Is...

13:14.840 --> 13:16.159
Is this Lin family...

13:16.799 --> 13:18.080
the one...

13:19.519 --> 13:20.480
I can't read.

13:21.759 --> 13:22.320
This...

13:24.840 --> 13:26.600
This... This is the character "Lin".

13:28.600 --> 13:29.799
Is it

13:32.559 --> 13:34.639
the Lin family I was betrothed to?

13:44.519 --> 13:46.279
They don't even know their place.

13:47.000 --> 13:48.200
Everyone in our compound,

13:48.240 --> 13:49.840
young and old,

13:49.960 --> 13:52.120
is born a servant of the Lin family.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.840
Servants born to servants.

13:54.940 --> 13:56.759
(Lin)

13:56.759 --> 13:58.320
Look. It's so beautiful.

13:58.519 --> 13:59.240
So pretty.

14:25.159 --> 14:25.759
Cry.

14:29.399 --> 14:30.919
If you want to cry, cry your heart out.

14:36.380 --> 14:37.360
Cry as hard as you can.

14:40.559 --> 14:41.600
Cry it all out.

14:43.159 --> 14:45.039
Then we'll live well afterward.

14:48.056 --> 14:49.150
Live with all your might.

14:51.879 --> 14:52.600
Live fiercely.

14:56.679 --> 14:57.799
Just like wild grass.

14:59.679 --> 15:01.200
Live shamelessly and freely.

15:02.919 --> 15:04.440
From now on,

15:07.480 --> 15:08.440
there'll only be spring

15:10.559 --> 15:11.600
and no winter.

15:19.039 --> 15:21.120
We'll live without a care.

15:53.279 --> 15:53.600
Here.

15:54.039 --> 15:54.840
Here, give it to me.

15:59.559 --> 16:00.200
Enough?

16:00.759 --> 16:01.320
That's enough.

16:01.519 --> 16:01.879
Enough.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.360
Just a little is enough.

16:06.840 --> 16:07.720
Keep your hand low,

16:08.320 --> 16:09.919
and the oil won't splatter on you.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.080
How is it?

16:15.159 --> 16:15.960
Feeling better today?

16:41.360 --> 16:43.080
No, I can't take your family's things.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.200
Why are you so polite?

16:44.360 --> 16:45.159
Take it.

16:45.240 --> 16:46.840
Keep it and eat it slowly.

16:47.720 --> 16:49.399
If it's good, tell me later.

16:49.519 --> 16:50.600
Keep it for yourselves.

16:51.279 --> 16:52.080
Take it.

16:52.120 --> 16:52.759
No.

16:52.759 --> 16:54.360
I can't take your things.

17:15.279 --> 17:15.799
Father.

17:16.440 --> 17:16.880
The paste.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.480
I've already put it up.

17:18.696 --> 17:19.350
How does it look?

17:19.400 --> 17:20.279
It's upside down.

17:21.752 --> 17:22.824
This is how it should be.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.880
Alright.

17:35.319 --> 17:36.519
Let's go. Come inside.

17:42.880 --> 17:43.519
Lanxiang.

17:44.079 --> 17:44.599
Come.

17:45.039 --> 17:45.839
I've got good stuff.

17:56.039 --> 17:56.839
Write one.

18:16.820 --> 18:21.740
(Six Years Later)

18:21.740 --> 18:31.380
(Xu)

18:31.380 --> 18:34.220
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

18:34.220 --> 18:35.300
(Xu Lanxiang)

18:35.300 --> 18:38.460
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

18:39.300 --> 18:42.980
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

18:43.880 --> 18:44.440
Father.

18:45.039 --> 18:46.079
Write this character.

18:46.720 --> 18:47.559
This is...

18:48.000 --> 18:48.799
"Xu".

18:49.319 --> 18:50.640
This is how you write "Xu"?

18:51.480 --> 18:51.920
Alright.

18:52.160 --> 18:52.880
Let me see.

18:53.039 --> 18:54.880
Start with a dot.

18:59.559 --> 19:01.680
Then draw a long horizontal stroke.

19:03.119 --> 19:04.519
Then two below.

19:05.660 --> 19:09.540
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

19:10.260 --> 19:13.620
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

19:14.340 --> 19:18.940
♪Four seasons wax and wane,
year after year♪

19:18.940 --> 19:21.980
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

19:22.700 --> 19:26.300
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

19:27.119 --> 19:27.960
Lanxiang.

19:29.839 --> 19:30.640
Mother.

19:30.720 --> 19:31.559
Come help me

19:31.839 --> 19:33.119
hang up the clothes.

19:42.599 --> 19:44.680
(Lv Family's Eldest and Youngest Sons)
Hit her.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.660
(Lv Ji'er)

20:00.759 --> 20:02.200
You little rascal!

20:02.240 --> 20:03.400
Give back the slingshot.

20:05.200 --> 20:05.880
Stop!

21:02.279 --> 21:03.000
You brat!

21:03.416 --> 21:05.030
You can't even do this simple task.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.920
What's the use of raising you?

21:06.920 --> 21:07.359
Look.

21:07.559 --> 21:08.039
Careful.

21:08.720 --> 21:09.400
Are you alright?

21:11.440 --> 21:12.480
Hurry and hang them up.

21:18.839 --> 21:19.640
Lanxiang.

21:20.319 --> 21:20.839
Father.

21:20.839 --> 21:21.440
We're here.

21:32.839 --> 21:33.359
What's wrong?

21:54.960 --> 21:55.839
All these years,

21:56.119 --> 21:57.599
I've been asking around

21:57.680 --> 21:59.359
where the Shen family was buried.

21:59.759 --> 22:01.359
But there was never any news.

22:02.039 --> 22:04.039
Today, a merchant from the capital

22:04.079 --> 22:05.759
came to the shop.

22:06.079 --> 22:07.880
He happened to mention

22:08.599 --> 22:10.079
that six years ago,

22:10.880 --> 22:11.559
someone

22:13.559 --> 22:16.559
collected the remains
of Grand Secretary Shen's family.

22:20.079 --> 22:20.759
Really?

22:20.880 --> 22:22.359
Absolutely.

22:23.240 --> 22:26.359
But he doesn't know

22:26.360 --> 22:27.240
who this kind soul is

22:27.304 --> 22:28.920
or where the Shen family was buried.

22:34.519 --> 22:36.359
May the Bodhisattva bless us.

22:36.359 --> 22:38.279
Amitabha.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.119
The stone in my heart

22:40.359 --> 22:41.519
has finally been lifted.

22:46.359 --> 22:47.000
Lanxiang.

22:47.720 --> 22:48.279
Go on.

22:49.192 --> 22:50.390
Light incense for your parents

22:50.559 --> 22:53.680
and your other family members.

22:53.960 --> 22:54.839
Amitabha.

22:55.416 --> 22:56.550
At least they're no longer

22:56.559 --> 22:58.799
restless spirits with nowhere to go.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.319
Father.

23:41.720 --> 23:42.559
Mother.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.440
Don't worry.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.799
The Xu family treats me very well.

23:52.279 --> 23:53.119
In this life,

23:54.920 --> 23:56.799
I'll be sure to treat them well

23:57.400 --> 23:58.759
and care for them until old age.

24:00.720 --> 24:01.519
In my next life,

24:04.559 --> 24:06.039
I'll be your daughter again.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.200
Heaven above,

24:19.839 --> 24:21.039
and Earth below, bear witness.

24:21.960 --> 24:24.759
Today, honorable men
have recovered the remains

24:25.039 --> 24:27.160
of the Shen family and Lanxiang

24:28.160 --> 24:29.640
and laid them all to rest.

24:30.568 --> 24:32.136
I owe them a debt beyond measure.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.799
I'll never forget what they've done,

24:35.519 --> 24:37.200
and I swear I'll repay them one day.

26:16.119 --> 26:17.839
(Lin Jinqi)
The rebel leader is dead.

26:18.660 --> 26:21.420
(Jinzhou Seaside Fishing Village)

26:23.920 --> 26:25.119
Those who resist...

26:27.440 --> 26:28.960
are to be killed without mercy.

26:38.000 --> 26:41.680
- Good!
- Good!

26:41.960 --> 26:44.780
- Good!
- Good!

26:44.780 --> 26:46.160
(Nanke, Lin Jinqi's Attendant)
Good!

26:46.160 --> 26:47.220
- Good!
- Good!

26:47.220 --> 26:49.176
(Jiugao, Lin Jinqi's Attendant)
Good!

26:49.208 --> 26:50.312
(Du Zheng, Courtesy Name Congyi, Junior)
- Good!

26:50.312 --> 26:51.500
(Banner Officer of the Jinzhou Guards)
Good!

26:51.500 --> 26:57.839
- Good!
- Good!

27:07.480 --> 27:08.960
Fresh chrysanthemum greens.

27:10.960 --> 27:12.039
Chrysanthemum greens.

27:13.140 --> 27:16.440
(Rongbao Pavilion)

27:16.440 --> 27:17.240
Look at Xu.

27:17.319 --> 27:18.359
Look at this mess.

27:18.519 --> 27:19.599
He finally minded the shop,

27:19.839 --> 27:21.359
yet he was so unlucky.

27:21.359 --> 27:22.599
He lost everything this time.

27:26.440 --> 27:27.160
You're here.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.279
Master Craftsman.

27:29.279 --> 27:30.740
(Rongbao Pavilion's Master Craftsman)

27:32.799 --> 27:33.400
Lanxiang.

27:33.512 --> 27:34.968
Bringing your father his lunch again?

27:35.080 --> 27:36.470
I'm going to the back to find him.

27:36.759 --> 27:37.480
Head Shopkeeper.

27:37.720 --> 27:38.359
Head Shopkeeper.

27:38.640 --> 27:39.839
Please take another look.

27:40.000 --> 27:41.240
Just one more look.

27:41.240 --> 27:41.960
Move aside.

27:42.559 --> 27:43.319
Get out of the way.

27:43.320 --> 27:45.064
Please take another look
at this painting.

27:45.160 --> 27:46.960
It really is a fine painting.

27:47.000 --> 27:48.160
Just take one more look.

27:48.480 --> 27:50.079
I told you to mind the shop.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.464
(Huang Youzhi)
Just mind it.

27:51.470 --> 27:53.580
(Rongbao Pavilion's Head Shopkeeper)
Look what happened.

27:53.680 --> 27:55.359
You took in a fake painting.

27:55.720 --> 27:57.480
I'm only making you pay five taels.

27:57.480 --> 27:59.359
That's already very merciful.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.960
Just look at it again.

28:01.240 --> 28:02.680
Get out of my way.

28:02.720 --> 28:03.359
Father.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.240
Useless fool.

28:05.279 --> 28:05.839
Lanxiang.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.119
This...

28:14.400 --> 28:16.640
How could this painting be fake?

28:29.640 --> 28:30.880
Five taels of silver?

28:31.559 --> 28:32.319
Five taels?

28:33.079 --> 28:33.839
How many nights

28:33.839 --> 28:35.119
will Lanxiang and I have to work

28:35.160 --> 28:36.559
to earn that much again?

28:37.559 --> 28:39.559
How could it be fake?

28:40.559 --> 28:41.599
That painting

28:41.839 --> 28:43.160
and the poem on it

28:43.880 --> 28:45.400
have this indescribable

28:46.079 --> 28:47.720
artistic charm.

28:47.759 --> 28:49.240
What artistic charm?

28:50.079 --> 28:51.079
You only learned

28:51.119 --> 28:52.440
a few characters from Lanxiang.

28:53.519 --> 28:55.400
You really think you're a scholar?

28:57.839 --> 28:58.839
I won't learn anymore.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.839
I'll never learn again!

29:01.160 --> 29:02.319
Never again!

29:02.519 --> 29:03.920
What's the use of learning?

29:04.759 --> 29:06.559
Learning to read only brought trouble.

29:07.400 --> 29:09.119
A good-for-nothing will always be one!

29:09.400 --> 29:10.640
Learning won't change that.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.920
I just thought...

29:32.720 --> 29:34.279
If that painting is real,

29:34.359 --> 29:35.160
and we sell it,

29:35.680 --> 29:38.160
I could get a silver tael as a reward.

29:45.319 --> 29:47.160
Lanxiang isn't young anymore.

29:49.440 --> 29:51.440
We need to save some money

29:52.039 --> 29:53.039
to buy her freedom.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.519
What else can we do?

29:55.400 --> 29:57.960
Are we going to let her be like us,

29:59.160 --> 30:01.839
two slaves
giving birth to another slave?

30:02.359 --> 30:04.079
Be slaves for generations to come?

30:11.359 --> 30:13.079
Father, Mother.

30:21.000 --> 30:21.960
I have an idea.

30:23.160 --> 30:24.759
We won't have to pay the five taels,

30:25.160 --> 30:25.839
and maybe

30:26.160 --> 30:27.519
we can even make some money.

30:30.799 --> 30:31.480
Really?

30:34.248 --> 30:36.700
(Rongbao Pavilion)

30:38.200 --> 30:38.960
Old Master.

30:39.920 --> 30:42.079
These just came in this month.

30:48.319 --> 30:49.799
This calligraphy is quite good.

30:53.000 --> 30:54.720
Didn't Father say before

30:54.960 --> 30:57.279
that Old Master Lin collects landscapes

30:57.559 --> 30:59.720
and visits the shop every ten days?

31:00.480 --> 31:02.240
As long as we see Old Master Lin...

31:02.839 --> 31:03.680
Old Master.

31:04.480 --> 31:07.240
What do you think of this calligraphy?

31:08.839 --> 31:09.720
It's good.

31:10.519 --> 31:11.240
Good.

31:12.079 --> 31:15.400
It's a pity we never get
an original by Li Yingqiu.

31:16.319 --> 31:17.960
Quite a few people have heard

31:18.000 --> 31:19.759
that you like Li Yingqiu,

31:20.440 --> 31:21.880
so they bring fake paintings to sell.

31:25.480 --> 31:26.799
Let's look upstairs.

31:41.519 --> 31:43.240
Who hung this painting here?

31:43.960 --> 31:44.680
Take it down.

31:44.680 --> 31:45.079
Quickly.

31:48.519 --> 31:49.440
Old Master.

31:49.839 --> 31:51.039
This fake painting

31:51.279 --> 31:53.359
was bought by a shop hand.

31:54.039 --> 31:55.880
That day, I went south of the city

31:55.920 --> 31:56.839
to buy antiques.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.240
I wasn't at the shop.

32:00.000 --> 32:01.400
Why are you hiding? Come here.

32:03.920 --> 32:05.079
Greetings, Old Master.

32:05.559 --> 32:06.279
Xu.

32:07.960 --> 32:08.960
It... It was him.

32:13.319 --> 32:15.119
Old Master will surely ask you

32:15.480 --> 32:16.960
why you took that painting.

32:17.759 --> 32:19.480
The brushwork and ink

32:19.599 --> 32:21.400
are very much like Li Yingqiu's style,

32:21.720 --> 32:22.440
but

32:22.519 --> 32:24.960
the inscription
uses the lampblack ink of Hui ink.

32:25.519 --> 32:27.680
Li Yingqiu
lived in the early Northern Song,

32:27.920 --> 32:29.000
but this lampblack ink

32:29.119 --> 32:31.319
hadn't appeared
in the early Northern Song.

32:31.720 --> 32:33.559
It's clearly a fake painting.

32:34.440 --> 32:36.240
That's exactly
what the head shopkeeper said.

32:37.160 --> 32:39.640
What if Old Master asks the same thing?

32:44.440 --> 32:46.319
Just answer

32:46.376 --> 32:47.512
why you took the painting.

32:48.060 --> 32:50.380
(Drifting Alone on the River)

32:50.680 --> 32:52.359
I just thought

32:53.400 --> 32:54.920
it had an artistic charm.

32:55.640 --> 32:56.799
Artistic charm?

32:57.559 --> 32:58.279
Yes.

32:58.359 --> 32:59.160
Artistic charm.

33:00.000 --> 33:02.079
I can't really explain it.

33:02.440 --> 33:05.880
I just thought the painting was good,

33:06.392 --> 33:07.880
and the calligraphy was good, too.

33:08.039 --> 33:09.319
But the best part

33:10.359 --> 33:12.799
is still this poem.

33:17.480 --> 33:20.440
Inscribed on the Cold Mountain Painting.

33:24.000 --> 33:26.319
You can tell Old Master Lin the truth.

33:26.360 --> 33:27.592
You don't understand poetry.

33:27.640 --> 33:29.680
You only learned
a few words from your daughter.

33:31.559 --> 33:33.319
But you're a hereditary slave.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.200
How could you know how to read?

33:35.680 --> 33:36.480
Mother.

33:36.559 --> 33:37.440
Don't you remember?

33:37.880 --> 33:39.000
When we were in the capital,

33:39.160 --> 33:40.440
I was often ill.

33:40.640 --> 33:42.839
The housekeeper feared
catching my illness

33:43.200 --> 33:44.440
and made us move out.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.559
The three of us

33:46.799 --> 33:48.799
had no choice but to stay at a nunnery.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.440
The nun there

33:50.440 --> 33:52.079
was very fond of my daughter.

33:52.480 --> 33:55.599
She often took her to chant prayers.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.680
That's how she learned to read.

33:59.880 --> 34:00.480
Also,

34:01.119 --> 34:02.960
ever since I came to Jinling

34:03.279 --> 34:04.839
and worked at Rongbao Pavilion,

34:05.240 --> 34:07.319
I've often received
the head shopkeeper's guidance.

34:07.720 --> 34:09.480
I don't understand much either.

34:09.639 --> 34:12.440
I just think this poem is well written.

34:13.840 --> 34:14.840
Xu.

34:15.320 --> 34:17.960
I told you not to take it to heart.

34:18.280 --> 34:19.199
Teaching you

34:19.199 --> 34:21.079
was also for the shop's sake.

34:24.480 --> 34:28.400
It seems Buddha intended

34:29.639 --> 34:32.480
for Li Yingqiu's Cold Mountain

34:33.159 --> 34:35.039
to see the light of day again.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.639
This painting...

34:41.760 --> 34:42.679
It's fake.

34:47.239 --> 34:48.840
Yet it's also real.

35:16.599 --> 35:19.840
This painting was once owned
by Scholar Yi'an.

35:20.920 --> 35:24.079
In her later years,
Scholar Yi'an suffered through war.

35:24.559 --> 35:26.599
Most of her antiques,
calligraphy, and paintings

35:26.880 --> 35:29.719
were looted and lost.

35:30.760 --> 35:32.519
To protect this painting,

35:33.079 --> 35:35.960
she made an identical copy

35:36.360 --> 35:39.679
and left an obvious flaw, lampblack ink,

35:39.760 --> 35:41.719
(By Heyang's Li Yingqiu)
in the inscription.

35:42.719 --> 35:45.519
This meant that
even if someone stole it,

35:45.679 --> 35:47.559
they'd think it was a forgery.

35:48.280 --> 35:52.519
They'd never imagine the original
was hidden beneath the fake.

35:53.280 --> 35:53.920
That's right.

35:54.840 --> 35:56.760
To find it later,

35:56.840 --> 35:58.000
Scholar Yi'an

35:58.280 --> 36:00.679
wrote this poem as a marker.

36:02.159 --> 36:03.559
Who would've thought?

36:04.840 --> 36:06.920
Who would've thought
that two centuries later,

36:07.679 --> 36:10.119
an uneducated servant

36:10.960 --> 36:13.039
would become her kindred spirit?

36:15.760 --> 36:18.119
They say fools can be lucky,

36:18.960 --> 36:21.960
but Xu is diligent, too.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.159
Our shop currently

36:24.159 --> 36:27.519
needs a third shopkeeper
for calligraphy and paintings.

36:28.280 --> 36:30.320
What do you think, Old Master?

36:30.840 --> 36:31.320
Well...

36:31.400 --> 36:32.599
You can decide

36:32.679 --> 36:33.480
the shop's affairs.

36:34.639 --> 36:35.199
Alright.

36:35.280 --> 36:37.920
Why wait for a better day
when today's perfect?

36:38.679 --> 36:39.760
Starting today,

36:39.920 --> 36:42.599
Xu is Rongbao Pavilion's

36:42.760 --> 36:44.280
third shopkeeper.

36:48.840 --> 36:49.559
Wonderful.

36:49.639 --> 36:50.360
Then...

36:50.920 --> 36:51.920
Congratulations, Xu.

36:52.119 --> 36:52.840
No.

36:53.159 --> 36:54.679
Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

36:54.728 --> 36:56.000
Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

36:56.040 --> 36:58.248
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

36:58.250 --> 36:59.688
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

37:00.760 --> 37:02.159
Thank you, Old Master.

37:07.360 --> 37:10.639
This is the reward Old Master gave you?

37:11.400 --> 37:12.760
It's ten taels.

37:12.840 --> 37:14.039
Ten taels.

37:19.880 --> 37:20.480
Lanxiang.

37:21.079 --> 37:22.559
Did you know all along

37:22.559 --> 37:24.079
that it was a genuine painting?

37:30.159 --> 37:31.119
When I was ten,

37:31.920 --> 37:34.119
I heard Grandfather tell this tale.

37:35.159 --> 37:36.440
When I saw that painting,

37:37.440 --> 37:38.519
I recognized it.

37:50.920 --> 37:52.280
You have a keen eye.

37:52.360 --> 37:54.440
You bought a genuine work right away.

37:55.039 --> 37:56.639
It's mainly thanks to your teaching.

37:56.920 --> 37:59.159
And thanks to your reminder

37:59.559 --> 38:01.920
not to offend the head shopkeeper.

38:24.119 --> 38:25.840
This is the six taels of silver

38:26.639 --> 38:29.400
our family has saved over the years.

38:29.800 --> 38:31.000
With this ten taels,

38:31.440 --> 38:32.800
we have 16 taels in total.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.639
I've already asked around.

38:35.079 --> 38:37.280
For a girl at Lanxiang's age,

38:37.599 --> 38:41.039
16 taels is more than enough
to buy her freedom.

38:42.519 --> 38:43.199
That's right.

38:43.559 --> 38:45.840
I'll find someone to ask our master

38:45.960 --> 38:47.079
to free Lanxiang.

38:48.039 --> 38:48.559
Put it away.

38:48.639 --> 38:49.360
Put it away.

38:49.440 --> 38:50.119
Father.

38:52.079 --> 38:52.880
Father.

38:53.519 --> 38:54.159
Mother.

38:55.159 --> 38:56.199
I'm very grateful

38:56.360 --> 38:57.639
for your kindness.

38:59.440 --> 39:01.000
But under the current law,

39:01.599 --> 39:02.920
I'm a hereditary slave.

39:03.064 --> 39:04.590
I can't be freed from servitude alone.

39:05.544 --> 39:07.960
What do you mean
you can't be freed from servitude alone?

39:08.400 --> 39:09.079
Then...

39:09.480 --> 39:12.840
Does that mean
you'll be a servant all your life?

39:13.480 --> 39:14.239
Yes.

39:14.719 --> 39:15.920
Mother, don't you remember?

39:16.519 --> 39:18.440
When Father sold himself
to the Lin family,

39:18.719 --> 39:20.199
he signed a life contract.

39:20.960 --> 39:21.960
That means

39:23.079 --> 39:25.559
we can be freed from servitude
with Father.

39:26.840 --> 39:28.079
With me?

39:28.400 --> 39:29.039
Yes.

39:29.272 --> 39:30.710
If we're being freed from servitude,

39:30.920 --> 39:32.760
we do it together.

39:33.119 --> 39:34.599
Be freed from servitude together?

39:35.400 --> 39:36.800
Be freed from servitude together.

39:37.199 --> 39:38.920
Become free citizens together.

39:40.904 --> 39:42.840
- Become free citizens?
- Become free citizens?

39:48.440 --> 39:49.159
But...

39:51.119 --> 39:53.440
How many years would we need
to save that much?

39:53.920 --> 39:57.320
We won't always get lucky like this.

39:57.440 --> 39:58.199
That's right.

39:58.519 --> 39:59.719
Father, don't you remember?

39:59.880 --> 40:02.000
You're the third shopkeeper now.

40:05.760 --> 40:06.960
That's true.

40:08.159 --> 40:09.599
You're the third shopkeeper now.

40:09.599 --> 40:11.239
Things are different now.

40:11.599 --> 40:12.920
Your monthly salary

40:12.960 --> 40:15.679
is much higher
than when you did odd jobs.

40:16.079 --> 40:18.159
And I'll get rewards for doing well.

40:18.599 --> 40:19.239
Lanxiang.

40:19.519 --> 40:21.840
Teach me more characters,

40:21.920 --> 40:22.440
and also

40:23.079 --> 40:26.000
teach me how to identify
paintings and calligraphy.

40:26.392 --> 40:28.440
I'll work hard to make more money.

40:28.559 --> 40:29.039
Sure.

40:29.800 --> 40:30.519
Then I...

40:31.039 --> 40:32.079
Starting tomorrow,

40:32.199 --> 40:33.840
I'll take on more embroidery work.

40:33.920 --> 40:34.480
Lanxiang.

40:34.599 --> 40:36.320
These patterns you drew for me

40:36.400 --> 40:37.199
are beautiful.

40:37.496 --> 40:38.590
I'll embroider them well

40:38.800 --> 40:40.880
and earn a few more coins.

40:46.320 --> 40:48.559
We'll work hard together

40:49.039 --> 40:51.000
and buy our freedom from the Lin family.

40:52.000 --> 40:52.960
When that day comes,

40:53.360 --> 40:54.920
Father will open a shop.

40:55.199 --> 40:56.800
I'll help out at the shop.

40:57.559 --> 41:00.599
Mother, you can just count the money.

41:04.039 --> 41:04.559
Sure.

41:07.020 --> 41:14.020
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

41:17.400 --> 41:20.079
Loquats! Fresh loquats!

41:22.480 --> 41:25.360
Loquats! Fresh loquats!

41:28.920 --> 41:29.559
Loquats!

41:29.559 --> 41:32.900
(Jinling Lin Residence)

41:33.800 --> 41:35.360
How novel!

41:36.039 --> 41:37.519
Red as cinnabar,

41:38.280 --> 41:39.920
and lovely as rouge.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.880
I've never seen it before.

41:43.519 --> 41:44.880
I wonder what it's called.

41:47.159 --> 41:48.519
It's a new item

41:48.880 --> 41:51.639
brought back from the West
by Defense Commander Zheng.

41:51.880 --> 41:54.599
It's called foreign pepper.

41:55.064 --> 41:56.490
- Foreign pepper?
- Foreign pepper?

41:56.719 --> 41:58.639
There are only a few pots

41:58.920 --> 42:00.280
in all of Jinling.

42:01.280 --> 42:03.239
It looks so festive.

42:03.320 --> 42:04.648
Quite fitting for the occasion.

42:05.679 --> 42:06.840
Congratulations, Lin.

42:06.860 --> 42:09.100
Your son distinguished himself
fighting Japanese pirates

42:09.128 --> 42:10.750
and has been promoted
to Vice Commander.

42:10.880 --> 42:12.400
He's been transferred back to Jinling.

42:12.599 --> 42:14.840
What a promising young man.

42:16.039 --> 42:17.639
He couldn't succeed in his studies,

42:17.679 --> 42:19.880
so he could only become a soldier.

42:20.039 --> 42:21.679
Lin, you're too modest.

42:22.000 --> 42:22.800
Master.

42:23.360 --> 42:24.039
Master.

42:24.760 --> 42:25.599
Master.

42:25.599 --> 42:26.400
(Yang Zhong, Lin Residence's)

42:26.400 --> 42:27.608
(Head Bulter)
Young Master is back.

42:31.039 --> 42:32.320
That wretched boy

42:32.360 --> 42:34.088
had to come back right now,
of all times.

42:34.199 --> 42:35.920
He just had to ruin everyone's mood.

43:05.380 --> 43:07.660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode Preview)

43:11.360 --> 43:12.559
Stand properly.

43:13.239 --> 43:15.119
Greet Young Master and Young Madam.

43:15.768 --> 43:17.032
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

43:17.048 --> 43:18.408
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

43:21.800 --> 43:23.239
There are 12 hereditary slaves

43:23.239 --> 43:24.760
who came of age this time.

43:25.800 --> 43:27.840
First Madam chose these four

43:28.920 --> 43:30.440
and ordered me to bring them

43:30.920 --> 43:33.000
to Zhichun Hall to serve you both.

43:35.360 --> 43:37.360
Please tell First Madam

43:37.688 --> 43:38.800
we appreciate her kindness,

43:39.039 --> 43:40.880
but Zhichun Hall has enough staff.

43:56.701 --> 44:00.821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.661 --> 44:08.181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.461 --> 44:13.381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:14.061 --> 44:16.821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.541 --> 44:19.861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:19.861 --> 44:22.941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.461 --> 44:28.701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.621 --> 44:35.781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.581 --> 44:41.141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:41.141 --> 44:44.701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.501 --> 44:51.181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.541 --> 44:55.861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:56.221 --> 44:59.181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:59.181 --> 45:02.941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.941 --> 45:05.821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:05.821 --> 45:09.901
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:09.901 --> 45:13.261
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:13.261 --> 45:17.021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:17.021 --> 45:21.021
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:21.781 --> 45:25.941
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:25.941 --> 45:29.381
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:29.381 --> 45:33.021
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:33.021 --> 45:35.901
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:35.901 --> 45:39.981
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:39.981 --> 45:43.341
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:43.341 --> 45:46.981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:46.981 --> 45:54.781
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
